0101048\r\nSteve John Shepherd::Naboo lieutenant::imdb:nm0791874\r\nBodie Taylor::Clone Trooper (s) (as Bodi \'Tindi\' Taylor)::imdb:nm1019974\r\nMatt Rowan::Orn Free Taa (as Matthew Rowan)::imdb:nm0746419\r\nSteven Boyle::Ask Aak::imdb:nm1239340\r\nZachariah Jensen::Jedi Knight Kit Fisto (as Zac Jensen)::imdb:nm1026084\r\nAlex Knoll::J.K. Burtola::imdb:nm1177114\r\nPhoebe Yiamkiati::Mari Amithest::imdb:nm0947953\r\nKenny Baker::R2-D2::imdb:nm0048652\r\nJerome Blake::Oppo Rancisis::imdb:nm0086592\r\nHassani Shapi::Eeth Koth::imdb:nm0788434\r\nGin Clarke::Adi Gallia (as Gin)::imdb:nm0164778\r\nKhan Bonfils::Saesee Tiin::imdb:nm0094416\r\nMichaela Cottrell::Even Piell::imdb:nm0183169\r\nDipika O\'Neill Joti::Depa Billaba::imdb:nm0642086\r\nHayley Mooy::Pooja Naberrie (scenes deleted)::imdb:nm0602192\r\nKeira Wingate::Ryoo Naberrie (scenes deleted)::imdb:nm0935002\r\nAmy Allen::Aayla Secura (uncredited)::imdb:nm1116989\r\nWilliam Clay::Ister Paddie (uncredited)::imdb:nm1593144\r\nMarton Csokas::Geonosian Archduke Poggle the Lesser (uncredited)::imdb:nm0190744\r\nRussell Darling::Coruscant Starfreighter Passenger (uncredited)::imdb:nm0201402\r\nC. Michael Easton::Bus driver (uncredited)::imdb:nm0247694\r\nNicole Fantl::Senator Lexi Dio (uncredited)::imdb:nm0974658\r\nSandi Finlay::Sly Moore (uncredited)::imdb:nm0971437\r\nHilton Howson::Toonbuck Toora (uncredited)::imdb:nm1287501\r\nMichael Ienna::Reeja Naberrie (uncredited)::imdb:nm2737380\r\nJesse Jensen::Saesee Tiin (arena sequences) (uncredited)::imdb:nm0421508\r\nNalini Krishan::Barriss Offee (uncredited)::imdb:nm1001233\r\nAmanda Lucas::Adnama, patron of the Outlander Club (uncredited)::imdb:nm0878741\r\nJett Lucas::Zett Jukassa (Young Padawan at Jedi Library) (uncredited)::imdb:nm1183068\r\nKatie Lucas::Lunae Minx (Purple Twi\'lek Girl at Outlander Club) (uncredited)::imdb:nm0337964\r\nLiam Neeson::Qui-Gon Jinn (voice) (uncredited) (archive footage)::imdb:nm0000553\r\nKyle Rowling::Joclad Danva (uncredited)::imdb:nm1176475\r\nJuan-Luis Sanchez::Temple Jedi (uncredited)::imdb:nm1190946\r\nSteve Sauers::Ronet Coorr (uncredited)::imdb:nm1056140\r\nMike Savva::Naboo Cruiser Security Guard (uncredited)::imdb:nm1979766\r\nP. Kevin Scott::Tatooine resident (uncredited)::imdb:nm0779642\r\nZeynup Selcuk::Zey Nep (uncredited)::imdb:nm1127435\r\nOrli Shoshan::Shaak Ti (uncredited)::imdb:nm1051353\r\nChris Truswell::Gilramos Libkath Mai Hill Tambor (voice) (uncredited)::imdb:nm0874455\r\nIan Watkin::COO-2180 (uncredited)::imdb:nm0914240\r\nR. Christopher White::Clone War Jedi (uncredited)::imdb:nm0925341\r\nEric Wong::Temple Jedi (uncredited)::imdb:nm0970523\r\nMatthew Wood::Voice of Magaloof / Voice of Seboca (uncredited)::imdb:nm0003214', 142, '', 'Die Star Wars Saga geht weiter mit Episode II - Angriff der Klonkrieger. Zehn Jahre nach der Schlacht um Naboo entgeht Senatorin Amidala einem heimtückischen Attentat. Um sie zu schützen, wird ihr Jede-Meister Obi Wan und sein Padawan Schüler Anakin Skywalker zur Seite gestellt. Während zwischen Anakin und Amidala eine verbotene Liebe entbrennt, rüsten sich die dunklen Mächte für einen gigantischen Krieg, der die gesamte Republik für immer vernichten könnte.  Atemberaubende Schlachten, Jodas furioses Laserschwert-Duell und bahnenbrechende visuelle Effekte - dieser Film setzt neue Maßstäbe!', '8', '\"V:\\Filme\\Star Wars II - Angriff der Klonkrieger\\Star Wars II - Angriff der Klonkrieger.mkv\"', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, 0, '2021-10-09 17:15:33', 9, '', '', 'http://ia.media-imdb.com/images/M/MV5BMjE1NTUyMzgxNF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTYwNjg5OTI5._V1._SX97_SY140_.jpg', '', '2008-10-14 20:18:52', 2),
