(791, '', 'Savage Garden - Superstars & Cannonballs - Live on Tour', '', 'Deutsch', 'R11F6D03', '', '', 'amazon:B000059YVD', 2001, './coverpics/791.jpg', 'Mark Adamson', '', 110, '', 'Filmed during the Australia leg of their massive world tour, SUPERSTARS AND CANNONBALLS takes you to the heart, soul, and nerve-centre of one of the world\'s most popular and succesful bands... and includes, exclusive to video, the never-before-seen, full length documentary \"PARALLEL LIVES\". In this intimate video journal, Darren and Daniel give unprecedented access to our cameras, allowing us to follow them on stage and behind the scenes...  What is revealed is  asurprisingly frank insight into the minds and experiences of two very talented individuals. For the very first time, Darren and Daniel talk candidly about their unique creative vollaboration, friendship and life on the road.  Accompanying this sensational documentary is the entire 90 minute LIVE AFFIRMATION CONCERT. Filmed in spectacular widescreen during their hometown Brisbane concert, a staggering eleven cameras bring to life the excitement and frenzy of the real concert experience.   So take the best seats in the house for the music video that will blow your mind away...  This is SAVAGE GARDEN like you\'ve never experienced before.    Intro  1. The Best Thing  2. Break Me Shake Me  3. To The Moon & Back  4. The Lover After Me  5. I Don\'t Know You Anymore  6. Santa Monica  7. Two Beds And A Coffee Machine  8. You Can Still Be Free  9. The Animal Song  10. Hold Me  11. Gunning Down Romance  12. Crash And Burn  13. Truly Madly Deeply  14. Chained To You  15. I Want You  16. I Knew I Loved You  17. Affirmation  Credits', '', '\"V:\\Filme\\Savage Garden - Superstars and Cannonball\\Savage Garden - Superstars and Cannonball.mkv\"', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, NULL, 0, '2019-03-04 18:16:56', 1, '', '', 'http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/414925G7C8L._SL500_AA240_.jpg', '', '2009-09-19 18:11:50', 2),
