(1794, '', 'Der Mondmann', '', 'Deutsch', 'R19F3D11', '', '', 'ofdb:2632-55908', 1999, './coverpics/1794.jpg', 'Milos Forman', 'Jim Carrey::Andy Kaufman / Tony Clifton::ofdb:554\nGerry Becker::Stanley Kaufman - Andy\'s Father::ofdb:23145\nGreyson Erik Pendry::::\nBrittany Colonna::::\nLeslie Lyles::::\nBobby Boriello::::\nGeorge Shapiro::::\nDanny DeVito::George Shapiro::ofdb:1599\nBudd Friedman::::\nTom Dreesen::::\nThomas Armbruster::::\nPamela Abdy::::\nWendy Polland::::\nGerry Robert Byrne::::\nCash Oshman::::\nMatt Price::::\nChristina Cabot::Meditation Student::ofdb:7231\nRichard Belzer::Himself::ofdb:22770\nMelanie Vesey::::\nMichael Kelly::Michael Kaufman::ofdb:23192\nMiles Chapin::::\nDr. Isadore Rosenfeld::::\nVincent Schiavelli::Maynard Smith - ABC Executive::ofdb:7047\nMolly Schaffer::::\nHoward West::::\nGreg Travis::::\nMaureen Mueller::::\nPhilip Perlman::Mama Rivoli\'s Angry Guy::ofdb:36856\nJessica Devlin::::\nPaul Giamatti::Bob Zmuda/Tony Clifton::ofdb:4579\nJeff Thomas::Andy\'s Stand-In::ofdb:19774\nRandall Carver::Himself::ofdb:24724\nPeter Bonerz::::\nHoward Keystone::::\nBrent Briscoe::Heavyset Technician::ofdb:23448\nRay Bokhour::::\nPatton Oswalt::Blue Collar Guy::ofdb:299\nCaroline Gibson::::\nConrad Roberts::::\nJeff Zabel::::\nMarilyn Sokol::::\nAngela Jones::Hooker::ofdb:4595\nKrystina Carson::::\nMark Davenport::::\nBert F. Balsam::::\nLonnie Hamilton::::\nRon Sanchez::::\nBilly D. Lucas::::\nPatricia Scanlon::::\nMax Alexander::::\nEd Mitchell::::\nReiko Aylesworth::Mimi::ofdb:1391\nMichael Villani::::\nCourtney Love::Lynne Margulies::ofdb:6551\nMaria Maglaris::::\nHeath Hyche::::\nRobert Holeman::::\nJim Ross::Wrestling Commentator::ofdb:12384\nJerry Lawler::Himself::ofdb:11587\nTamara Bossett::::\nGene LeBell::::\nBob Zmuda::::\nBrian Peck::::\nCaroline Rhea::Fridays Melanie::ofdb:9673\nMary Lynn Rajskub::Friday\'s Mary::ofdb:3655\nPhilip Lenkowsky::::\nRob Steiner::::\nClaudia Jaffee::::\nArmando Guerrero::::\nLance Russell::::\nLadi